'''Combee''' (Japanese: '''ミツハニー''' ''Mitsuhoney'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

