==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Plasma Storm|Combee|4}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Storm}} expansion.
*'''Call for Family''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Jungle|Bellsprout|49}} and {{TCG ID|Jungle|Nidoran♀|57}}, both from the {{TCG|Jungle}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

